#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:5
#: 9d78e32a240445738676488c5412a9a5
msgid "Telemetry Logs"
msgstr "数传日志"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:7
#: 647bf953089a45e3b42770fff0db095b
msgid ""
"Telemetry logs (also known as \"tlogs\") are recorded by the ground station "
"when you connect ArduPilot to your computer via a :ref:`telemetry link "
"<common-telemetry-landingpage>`. This topic explains how to configure and "
"access tlogs."
msgstr ""
"数传日志（也称为「tlog」）由地面站在通过 :ref:`数传链路 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` 将 "
"ArduPilot 连接到计算机时记录。本主题介绍如何配置和访问 tlog。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:12
#: 95e040e88afd4821a634429e71c0af40
msgid ""
":ref:`Dataflash logs <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner>` collect similar information to tlogs (see :ref:`Diagnosing "
"problems using Logs <common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs>` for more "
"information)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Dataflash 日志 <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner>` 与 tlog 收集的信息类似（更多信息参见 :ref:`使用日志诊断问题 <common-diagnosing-problems-"
"using-logs>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:16
#: ccfeed6f07ca4736a9be09ed26c5057b
msgid "When and where tlogs are created"
msgstr "tlog 的创建时间和位置"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:18
#: 21054221b94a443f9ca0ecffb9565a79
msgid ""
"Tlogs are recordings of the MAVLink telemetry messages sent between the "
"autopilot and the ground station and are automatically created the moment "
"you press the connect button on the ground station."
msgstr "tlog 是飞控与地面站之间 MAVLink 数传消息的录制文件，在地面站按下连接按钮的瞬间自动创建。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:22
#: 8b7d4fec864f4597b94937d545463466
msgid ""
"If using the Mission Planner, files of the format YYYY-MM-DD hh-mm-ss.tlog "
"appear in the \"logs\" subfolder in your Mission Planner installation folder"
" or to the location you select in the Planner options [Config/Tuning] "
"[Planner]."
msgstr ""
"使用 Mission Planner 时，格式为 YYYY-MM-DD hh-mm-ss.tlog 的文件将出现在 Mission Planner "
"安装文件夹的「logs」子文件夹中，或您在「Config/Tuning」->「Planner」选项中指定的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:27
#: fb1d95d68397401d90c85c38f6056fed
msgid ""
"Besides the \".tlog\" files, \".rlog\" files are also created.  These "
"contain all the .tlog data plus additional debug output from the mission "
"planner.  but cannot be parsed or played back so they should be ignored."
msgstr ""
"除「.tlog」文件外，还会同时创建「.rlog」文件，其中包含所有 .tlog 数据以及来自 Mission Planner "
"的额外调试输出，但无法解析或回放，可忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:34
#: 84f48557efe14f1e9321f419cc3e2a2e
msgid "Setting the datarate"
msgstr "设置数据速率"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:36
#: 00212b473cd044d9b7fcacb5ab40b371
msgid ""
"The desired rate at which data is sent from the autopilot to the ground "
"station can be controlled through the mission planner's Config/Tuning > "
"Planner screen's Telemetry drop-downs.  Because all data sent over the "
"telemetry link is also recorded in the tlog, this also controls the rate of "
"data saved to the tlogs."
msgstr ""
"飞控向地面站发送数据的速率可通过 Mission Planner "
"的「Config/Tuning」->「Planner」页面上的数传下拉菜单控制。由于所有通过数传链路发送的数据也会被记录到 tlog，这同时控制了保存到"
" tlog 的数据速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:38
#: 9a4cfc9b2c774521ade2657b056d6515
msgid ""
"Note that due to bandwidth limitations, the actual rate of the data sent and"
" saved may be lower than the rate requested."
msgstr "请注意，由于带宽限制，实际发送和保存的数据速率可能低于请求的速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:44
#: 6dbbc50689fb49828d23074070b8b273
msgid "Playing back missions"
msgstr "回放任务"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:46
#: 59ec2cfdc4d04426bbe234ad918b1dc8
msgid "It is possible to play back a tlog by doing the following:"
msgstr "可按以下步骤回放 tlog："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:48
#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:77
#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:129
#: 0b0cf440b98848488469370133f5e972 7edacfabe18e4a628029fc3f4989766b
#: cc9e707639e94c019439afe549e6fbc1
msgid "Open the mission planner's Flight Data screen"
msgstr "打开 Mission Planner 的飞行数据画面"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:49
#: 86043d387502412c980ccc7090764cf4
msgid "click on the Telemetry Logs tab"
msgstr "点击「Telemetry Logs」标签页"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:50
#: abf7340c905c46efbc7b79b74941cf2f
msgid "Press \"Load Log\" and find the flight's tlog file"
msgstr "点击「Load Log」并找到飞行的 tlog 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:51
#: 2712358a10464d1bb5ff03632128f61b
msgid "Press \"Play\""
msgstr "点击「Play」"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:56
#: c1642f2fe41d439098696ce530487c84
msgid ""
"You can also jump to the point of interest in the log using the slider and "
"control the speed of the playback with the predefined Speed buttons."
msgstr "还可以使用滑块跳转到日志中感兴趣的位置，并使用预设速度按钮控制回放速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:59
#: e6fb56c3c7fb434ab821671e94832034
msgid ""
"While the log is replaying, the HUD will move and the vehicles location on "
"the map will update as it did during the flight.  Individual data values can"
" be seen through the Status tab and you can even display them in a graph by "
"clicking on the \"Tuning\" checkbox under the map and then double clicking "
"on the data legend to bring up a box from which you can choose exactly which"
" data fields are graphed as shown below.  This will show the recorded data "
"changing as the flight progresses."
msgstr ""
"日志回放过程中，HUD "
"将随之移动，地图上飞行器的位置也将更新，与飞行时一致。可通过「Status」标签页查看各数据值，也可点击地图下方的「Tuning」复选框并双击数据图例，弹出窗口后选择要绘制的数据字段，以图表方式显示，如下图所示。图表将显示飞行过程中记录数据的变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:73
#: 0ef1251d14214bc38d7586dbbc2336bc
msgid "Creating 3d images of the flight path"
msgstr "创建飞行路径的三维图像"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:75
#: 99eb1ec486c54dacb2f9ff3bf8f45427
msgid "You can create KMZ files by doing this:"
msgstr "可按以下步骤创建 KMZ 文件："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:78
#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:130
#: a90f06dd185a4ae2883a6fa458bc7870 e61928dfabcd4af290e6ff7ad8e3b1bb
msgid "Click on the Telemetry Logs tab"
msgstr "点击「Telemetry Logs」标签页"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:79
#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:131
#: 14344fa16ffb4149aa8bcd2cfd3141ef 2194ab40b5e44cddac08828fa735eb13
msgid "Press the \"Tlog > Kml or Graph\" button"
msgstr "点击「Tlog > Kml or Graph」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:80
#: cd603639ebf94abca15f90a73ffd8730
msgid "Press the \"Create KML + GPX\" button"
msgstr "点击「Create KML + GPX」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:81
#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:133
#: 0d12fa31dcc443e2a7cb0484e2b3908d 97eb28ac719b4a9b9baf28a6e16e00e2
msgid "select the flight tlog"
msgstr "选择飞行的 tlog 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:86
#: 3b9fc53935e04ea594d6d74df0bb7890
msgid ""
"A .kmz and .kml file will be created along side the original .tlog and this "
"can be opened in google earth to interactively view the 3d flight path. You "
"can open the kmz file in Google Earth to view the flight or path. Just "
"double click the file or drag it and drop into Google Earth."
msgstr ""
"将在原始 .tlog 文件旁生成 .kmz 和 .kml 文件，可在 Google Earth 中打开以交互方式查看三维飞行路径。双击文件或将其拖放到 "
"Google Earth 中即可打开。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:94
#: 20c99078210941ec8bab407842a9d111
msgid ""
"The different flight modes used during the flight will appear as different "
"colored tracks.  You can change some details about how the flight paths are "
"displayed including their color and whether the paths extend to the ground "
"by doing this:"
msgstr "飞行过程中使用的不同飞行模式将显示为不同颜色的轨迹。可按以下步骤更改飞行路径的显示细节，包括颜色以及路径是否延伸至地面："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:99
#: c8c96c0b261c43a79497c4136529eb92
msgid ""
"Find the log file’s name in the “Places” pane on the left.  It should appear"
" in a “Temporary Places” folder."
msgstr "在左侧「位置」面板中找到日志文件名，应显示在「临时位置」文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:101
#: 7129acb76592428bb650904269f3bb5b
msgid ""
"Right click on an individual path and select “Properties” to open the Edit "
"Path window."
msgstr "右键单击某条路径，选择「属性」以打开编辑路径窗口。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:103
#: 2c263368eba141529a1d2aea6ddca80f
msgid "The color can be changed on the “Style, Color” tab"
msgstr "可在「样式、颜色」标签页更改颜色。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:104
#: 2c44240621b24a49ba6a07a6b3366d13
msgid ""
"The area below the path can be removed (added) on the “Altitude” tab by un-"
"checking (checking) “Extend path to ground”"
msgstr "可在「高度」标签页通过取消勾选（或勾选）「将路径延伸至地面」来移除（或添加）路径下方的区域。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:108
#: b365e9e9a0de40f8b27c08973d06c924
msgid "Extracting parameters and Waypoints"
msgstr "提取参数和航点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:110
#: 3592f377b5574399ac90f674a4a0b16e
msgid ""
"You can extract the parameters and waypoints from the tlog by following the "
"same steps as for creating the KML file except that at the last step select "
"\"Extract Params\" or \"Extract WPs\"."
msgstr ""
"可按照创建 KML 文件的相同步骤从 tlog 中提取参数和航点，最后一步选择「Extract Params」或「Extract WPs」即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:114
#: 9e380db8a40a448f9c343efb47dfea39
msgid ""
"Extract Params will cause a .param file to be created along side the tlog.  "
"This file is tab separated and contains a full list of parameters (in the "
"same order as they appear in the eeprom) along with their values during the "
"flight.  This can be opened in excel or a text editor."
msgstr ""
"「Extract Params」将在 tlog 旁生成一个 .param 文件，该文件以制表符分隔，包含飞行期间的完整参数列表（与在 EEPROM "
"中的顺序相同）及其值，可在 Excel 或文本编辑器中打开。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:119
#: 7efdb409948f42d29cdbb6e602ff29a1
msgid ""
"Extract WPs will create one or more .txt files containing any missions "
"uploaded to the autopilot.  These files can be opened in the Mission Planner"
" by switching to the Flight Plan screen, right-mouse-button clicking on the "
"map and selecting \"File Load/Save\", \"Load WP File\"."
msgstr ""
"「Extract WPs」将创建一个或多个 .txt 文件，包含已上传到飞控的任务。这些文件可在 Mission Planner "
"中通过切换到飞行规划画面，右键单击地图选择「File Load/Save」->「Load WP File」来打开。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:125
#: e72ab59b71aa4405aea88420b6850db2
msgid "Graphing data from a flight"
msgstr "对飞行数据进行图表分析"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:127
#: 5fd0b02f6d5345658007e2861c126fd3
msgid "Data from the flight can be graphed by doing the following:"
msgstr "可按以下步骤对飞行数据进行图表分析："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:132
#: c0b77530130344a8bfb85fa29ceeb3aa
msgid "Press the \"Graph Log\" button"
msgstr "点击「Graph Log」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:138
#: 48e8d947a2544568b558b1ec6282d054
msgid ""
"When the \"Graph This\" screen appears, use the left or right mouse button "
"to click on the checkboxes beside the items you wish to graph.  Note that "
"the items are grouped into categories like \"RC_CHANNELS\" and \"RAW_IMU\" "
"although it's still often difficult to find exactly the item you wish to "
"graph"
msgstr ""
"当「Graph "
"This」画面出现时，用鼠标左键或右键点击要绘制的项目旁的复选框。注意这些项目按「RC_CHANNELS」和「RAW_IMU」等类别分组，但有时仍难以精确找到所需项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:143
#: 817475b05c404b3e8fa59a0de5ea7271
msgid ""
"If you use the left mouse button the scale for the item will appear on the "
"left of the graph.  If you use the right mouse button it will appear on the "
"right"
msgstr "使用鼠标左键时，该项目的刻度将显示在图表左侧；使用鼠标右键时，将显示在右侧。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:146
#: 5bb13b2c3704443990565dfcf6177c3e
msgid ""
"Click the checkbox multiple times to cycle through all the possible colours"
msgstr "多次点击复选框可循环切换所有可用颜色。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:148
#: c4517f8b44f546e28da61531d4b8b650
msgid ""
"Change the zoom of the graph with your mouse's middle wheel, by select an "
"area of the graph with the left mouse button held down or by right-mouse-"
"button clicking on the graph and selecting \"Set Scale To Default\""
msgstr "可通过鼠标滚轮缩放图表，按住鼠标左键拖选区域，或右键单击图表选择「Set Scale To Default」。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-telemetry-logs.rst:157
#: 543dc51f6b05469990edac8893208289
msgid "Video overview of tlogs"
msgstr "tlog 视频概述"
